notes: >
  This project reports a per-task capability matrix for its benchmark
  (16 tasks / 8 tracks: 0 VALIDATED / 6 PARTIALLY_VALIDATED / 3
  UNDERPOWERED / 0 NOT_VALIDATED / 7 NOT_EVALUABLE), not a single overall
  score, and documents multiple honest negative/underpowered findings
  alongside its positive results. See README.md and
  docs/MASTER_RECORD_CONTENT.md before citing any specific capability
  claim.
